// vNextApprover* = the CURRENT routing values, so Current Approver is untouched;
// blank on a brand-new record => falls back to the creator.
// Dept Approver passes the combobox: blank (nothing picked) => keep stored value.
// vStayAfterSave keeps the user on the form instead of navigating to scr_list.
// First-time save of a new record still stamps RequestNum and fires the flow
// with TriggerAction: "Created" (that logic is inside invisSave and keys off
// vIsNew / blank vSelectedRequest). Quick saves of EXISTING records write a
// blank TriggerAction, so the flow does not fire.
// If you have a required-fields check, wrap this whole block in it and only
// run the Sets + Select when validation passes.
